    "detailed_description": "This is the story of a group of girl ninjas who fight against &quot;Super Insect Fortress Antross&quot;, which has been revived from ancient times.<br>The story portion of the game proceeds in the form of an adventure game, with full-scale battle scenes against the ant-men at key points.<br>In the middle of the game, the main character, Suzuka Wakatabe, has to choose a pair of three companions, and the story changes depending on the character she chooses.<br><br>Combat is by command selection.<br>Each of the three paired ninja girls has different specialties such as swordsmanship and ninjutsu.<br>Winning battles increases &quot;ninja power,&quot; which allows the ninja to perform a series of ninja attacks.<br><br>This is the first of a three-part long adventure game!<br><br>Produced by Takami Akai of &quot;Princess Maker&quot;.<br>Character design is by Atsuko Ishida of &quot;Magic Knight Rayearth&quot;.<br>Directed by Nao Minda of &quot;Battle Skin Panic&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.poster.avif?t=1679732745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.webm?t=1679732745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.mp4?t=1679732745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "This is the story of a group of girl ninjas who fight against &quot;Super Insect Fortress Antross&quot;, which has been revived from ancient times.<br>The story portion of the game proceeds in the form of an adventure game, with full-scale battle scenes against the ant-men at key points.<br>In the middle of the game, the main character, Suzuka Wakatabe, has to choose a pair of three companions, and the story changes depending on the character she chooses.<br><br>Combat is by command selection.<br>Each of the three paired ninja girls has different specialties such as swordsmanship and ninjutsu.<br>Winning battles increases &quot;ninja power,&quot; which allows the ninja to perform a series of ninja attacks.<br><br>This is the first of a three-part long adventure game!<br><br>Produced by Takami Akai of &quot;Princess Maker&quot;.<br>Character design is by Atsuko Ishida of &quot;Magic Knight Rayearth&quot;.<br>Directed by Nao Minda of &quot;Battle Skin Panic&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.poster.avif?t=1679732745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.webm?t=1679732745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986250/extras/2dbf894bd76bd0e3c3fae0da3806ed52.mp4?t=1679732745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
